    "text": "This is a complete single-stage spur reducer: a two-piece housing with two shaft assemblies. The brief does not limit the scope, so the plan includes the bearings, seals, keys and cover fasteners a working reducer needs. It adds no motor, base frame or couplings. The 3:1 ratio is met with a 20-tooth pinion driving a 60-tooth gear at module 2, which gives an 80 mm centre distance. The housing is a machined aluminium box with a bolted side cover, and each shaft runs in a pair of deep-groove ball bearings. The input shaft exits through the body and the output shaft exits through the cover.\n\n```fw-plan\n{\"summary\": \"Single-stage 3:1 spur gear reducer: m2 20T pinion driving 60T gear at 80 mm centres, two shafts on ball bearings in a machined aluminium housing with bolted cover.\",\n \"assumptions\": [\"Rated for a small drive of about 1.5 kW at 1500 rpm input; no torque or speed was given\", \"Module 2, 20 deg pressure angle, 20 mm face width, 20T/60T for an exact 3:1 ratio, 80 mm centre distance\", \"Housing split as a body and a flat side cover, machined from 6061 aluminium, oil splash lubricated\", \"Input shaft exits through the body wall, output shaft through the cover, on opposite sides\", \"Bearings 6204-2RS on the input shaft and 6206-2RS on the output shaft\", \"Shafts in 42CrMo4 / 4140, gears in case-hardened 20MnCr5 or 4140 through-hardened\", \"Customer supplies couplings, motor and mounting base\"],\n \"subassemblies\": [\n  {\"name\": \"Housing\", \"description\": \"Machined gearbox body and side cover carrying both bearing pairs, aligned by dowels and closed with screws.\",\n   \"parts\": [\n    {\"name\": \"Gearbox body\", \"family\": \"machined\", \"complexity\": 5, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Open-sided 6061 aluminium box, about 210 x 70 x 160 mm (assumed), with a 180 x 50 mm internal cavity, bored seats for 47 mm and 62 mm bearings at 80 mm centres, a seal bore for the input shaft, a cover flange with tapped M6 holes and dowel holes, and foot mounting holes in the base.\", \"envelope\": [210, 70, 160]},\n    {\"name\": \"Side cover\", \"family\": \"machined\", \"complexity\": 4, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"6061 aluminium plate about 210 x 160 x 30 mm (assumed) with matching bearing bosses for 47 mm and 62 mm bearings at 80 mm centres, a seal bore for the output shaft, 8 clearance holes for M6 and 2 dowel holes.\", \"envelope\": [210, 160, 30], \"mounts_on\": \"Gearbox body\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Cover screw\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 8, \"description\": \"ISO 4762 M6 x 20 socket head cap screw, 8.8, fixing the side cover to the body.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Gearbox body\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Cover dowel\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 2, \"description\": \"ISO 8734 6 m6 x 20 dowel pin locating the side cover on the body.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Gearbox body\"}\n   ]},\n  {\"name\": \"Input shaft assembly\", \"description\": \"High-speed shaft carrying the 20T pinion, supported on two 6204 bearings, with a keyed extension for the motor coupling.\",\n   \"parts\": [\n    {\"name\": \"Input shaft\", \"family\": \"turned\", \"complexity\": 3, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Stepped 4140 shaft with 20 mm bearing and pinion seats, a 25 mm shoulder and a 20 mm keyed drive extension; overall length about 150 mm (assumed).\", \"envelope\": [25, 25, 150]},\n    {\"name\": \"Pinion\", \"family\": \"gear\", \"complexity\": 3, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Spur pinion, m2, 20 teeth, 40 mm PCD, 44 mm OD, 20 mm face, 20 mm keyed bore, case-hardened steel.\", \"envelope\": [44, 44, 20], \"mounts_on\": \"Input shaft\", \"module\": 2, \"teeth\": 20},\n    {\"name\": \"Input bearing\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 2, \"description\": \"6204-2RS deep-groove ball bearing, 20 x 47 x 14 mm, one in the body and one in the cover.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Input shaft\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Input seal\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Radial lip seal 20 x 35 x 7 mm in the body wall around the input extension.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Gearbox body\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Pinion key\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"DIN 6885 A parallel key 6 x 6 x 18 mm fixing the pinion to the input shaft.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Input shaft\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Input drive key\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"DIN 6885 A parallel key 6 x 6 x 28 mm on the input extension for the customer coupling.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Input shaft\"}\n   ]},\n  {\"name\": \"Output shaft assembly\", \"description\": \"Low-speed shaft carrying the 60T gear, supported on two 6206 bearings, with a keyed output extension.\",\n   \"parts\": [\n    {\"name\": \"Output shaft\", \"family\": \"turned\", \"complexity\": 3, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Stepped 4140 shaft with 30 mm bearing and gear seats, a 35 mm shoulder and a 30 mm keyed output extension; overall length about 170 mm (assumed).\", \"envelope\": [35, 35, 170]},\n    {\"name\": \"Output gear\", \"family\": \"gear\", \"complexity\": 3, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Spur gear, m2, 60 teeth, 120 mm PCD, 124 mm OD, 20 mm face, 30 mm keyed bore, through-hardened 4140; lightening web optional.\", \"envelope\": [124, 124, 20], \"mounts_on\": \"Output shaft\", \"module\": 2, \"teeth\": 60},\n    {\"name\": \"Output bearing\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 2, \"description\": \"6206-2RS deep-groove ball bearing, 30 x 62 x 16 mm, one in the body and one in the cover.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Output shaft\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Output seal\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"Radial lip seal 30 x 47 x 7 mm in the side cover around the output extension.\", \"mounts_on\": \"Side cover\"},\n    {\"name\": \"Gear key\", \"family\": \"standard\", \"complexity\": 1, \"qty\": 1, \"description\": \"DIN 6885 A parallel key 8 x 7 x